 lo · next: carrot dessert · default-dinner candidate. Sleep plan: ☰ S
 leep / jet lag. do-c gap: out 11:00 / in 15:00 · bags at desk · cash+ID
  in Patagonia Atom sling.\n----\n到着・モティ✓\n目的：到着
