BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:d-2026-07-29@japan-2026
DTSTAMP:20260731T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260729
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260730
SUMMARY:Akiba browse · Shinjuku mapo · Moti
DESCRIPTION:Option C holds: browse today\, buy tomorrow with bike + 50L. R
 emaining order: MUJI\, then Isetan last (closes 20:00)\, then Akiba brows
 e\, then Moti. ⚠ THE 50L IS IN AN EBISU STN COIN LOCKER (in at the 11:0
 0–15:00 do-c clean-out) — collect it tonight: lockers bill by calenda
 r day\, and the 09:30 bike pickup on 30 Jul depends on having it. Buy-if-
 light OK: small MUJI detergent · light envelopes. Initial D mapo from 8/
 1 only. Skip Asakusa today — tail + Benizuru 7am shop tickets + Iyoshi.
 \n① Breakfast — West Georgia St. does not exist. Walked to 恵比寿
 南2-3-15 OKA7ビル3F: no such shop. Treat as closed. EBISU FOOD HALL in
 stead ✓ — 恵比寿南1-1-9 シマヤビル1F · ~2 min from Ebisu St
 n · from 9:00. Would repeat — food good not remarkable\, but strong AC
  and a chill room\, easy solo.\n② Dollar Ranger ✓ DONE — foreign-cu
 rrency exchange (not packing/sundries\; that note was wrong). 160.55 JPY/
 USD · ¥802\,750 for $5\,000 · no commission. Mid-market 161.8\, so a 1
 .25 yen spread = 0.77% — street counters run 2–4% and airports 5–8%
 . Best-rate reputation now verified\, not repeated.\n③ Isetan ✓ DONE 
 — Diptyque browsed and the mens scent is a yes. LOCKED: 8 bottles\, bou
 ght 30 Jul on the Shinjuku dinner return with the 50L (~3.5–4 kg\, too 
 heavy for tonight). Mens wallets confirmed present ✓ — closer look 30
  Jul\, main building + 伊勢丹メンズ館. Ask for 印傳屋 / 甲州
 印伝 by name: Mitsukoshi-Isetan stocks Indenya including Isetan-exclusi
 ve patterns. Deerskin with lacquer\, a Kofu craft — the answer to not w
 anting an expensive wallet for its own sake. 印傳屋 上原勇七 is th
 e 総本家\; 印傳の山本 is a different inden house\, so name the ma
 ker.\n④ Kinokuniya — ERRAND FAILED ✗ okozukai / ポチ袋 not stock
 ed\, walked it. It is a bookstore\; stationery is pens and notebooks. Do 
 not route here for envelopes.\n⑤ Kagaya ✓ DONE — and the taste test
  settled it: Seven Stars wins. The Peace 10-pack was bought instead of th
 e tin\, tried\, and the tin is CANCELLED — no return visit. Seven Stars
  is a konbini staple\, buyable anywhere. The ¥600 test just saved a tin-
 sized mistake.\n⑥ MUJI confirmed: 無印良品 新宿通り — 新宿3
 -17-1 いさみやビル B1-3F · 10:00–21:00 daily · detergent is B1\
 , 掃除・洗濯用品 · same block as Kinokuniya (3-17-7). NOT Lumine 
 (opens 11:00).\n⑦ Lunch ✓ DONE: 陳麻婆豆腐 新宿野村 B2F — 
 very good\, noteworthy.\nShoes CLOSED (was ⑨) ✗ — skipped\, current
  shoes are fine\; the real need was socks\, ✓ done at the Akiba Uniqlo.
  For the record: GRAND STAGE ルミネエスト新宿 (east exit\, 11:00
 –21:00) is the large-format branch that carries US12 ≈ JP30\, should 
 shoes ever come back.\n⑧ Akiba Yodobashi ✓ WALKED — both target ite
 ms ABSENT. No SXC-1 and no White Wings in the store. The browse/buy split
  is therefore moot: there was nothing to defer. Wins anyway: the building
  has a Daiso (ポチ袋 ✓ DONE — closes the envelope errand Kinokuniy
 a failed) and a Uniqlo (socks ✓ DONE). ⚠ Consequence: tomorrow has no
  reason to return to Akiba — see 30 Jul. If the two items are still wan
 ted they need a different kind of shop: instruments (Ishibashi / Shimamur
 a) for the Casio\, a specialist hobby shop for the gliders. Note the patt
 ern — West Georgia\, Dollar Ranger and now these two all came from the 
 same source.\n⑩ Dinner LOCKED: Moti 六本木 — Hibiya Line runs Akih
 abara→Roppongi DIRECT\, no transfer. keema mutter + naan + mixed pickle
 s · carrot dessert · no other curries.\nClosed out: packing materials w
 as never a real errand — it was an artifact of the wrong "cheap packing
 /sundries" note on Dollar Ranger. Deleted\, not re-homed. ポチ袋: buy 
 anywhere\, sold widely — no special trip\, no Origami Kaikan detour. To
 night the only hard item is the 50L from the Ebisu locker\; socks and eve
 rything else can slide.\n----\n新宿麻婆·モティ（秋葉は下見
 ）\nオプションC継続：今日は下見、明日 自転車+50Lで
 購入。 残りの順序：無印 → 伊勢丹（新宿最後・20時
 閉店）→ 秋葉下見 → モティ。⚠ 50Lは恵比寿駅のコイ
 ンロッカー（11:00〜15:00の清掃時間で預入）— 今夜必
 ず回収：ロッカーは暦日課金、かつ7/30 09:30の自転車受
 取に必要。\n① 朝食：West Georgia St.は存在せず → EBISU F
 OOD HALL ✓（恵比寿南1-1-9・駅2分・9時〜）。再訪あり。
 \n② ダラーレンジャー ✓完了 — 外貨両替（梱包材の
 店ではない）。160.55円/ドル・5\,000ドルで802\,750円・手
 数料なし。仲値161.8に対しスプレッド1.25円＝0.77%（街
 中2〜4%・空港5〜8%）。好レートを実地で確認。\n③ 伊
 勢丹 ✓完了 — ディプティックのメンズは好感触。確
 定：8本を7/30に購入（新宿夕食時・50L使用／約3.5〜4kg
 ）。紳士財布あり ✓ — 7/30に本腰（本館＋メンズ館）
 。\n④ 紀伊國屋 ✗ 失敗 — ポチ袋の取扱なし（実地確
 認）。書店であり文具はペン・ノート。ポチ袋目当て
 で来ない。\n⑤ かがや ✓完了 — 試し買いの結論：セ
 ブンスターの勝ち。缶ピースは中止・再訪不要（セブ
 ンスターはコンビニで可）。10本入りの試し買いが正
 解だった。\n⑥ 無印良品 新宿通り（新宿3-17-1 いさみ
 やビル B1-3F・10:00〜21:00）· 洗剤はB1 掃除・洗濯用品· 
 紀伊國屋と同ブロック。ルミネ店ではない（11時開店
 ）。\n⑦ 昼 ✓完了：陳麻婆豆腐 新宿野村 B2F — とて
 も良い。\n靴は完了扱い（旧⑨）✗ — 見送り・今の靴
 で十分。実需は靴下で秋葉のユニクロで✓完了。参考
 ：GRAND STAGE ルミネエスト新宿（東口・11:00〜21:00）が30c
 m対応の大型店。\n⑧ 秋葉ヨドバシ ✓実地 — 目当ての
 2点とも在庫なし（SXC-1なし・ホワイトウイングスなし
 ）。下見／購入の切り分けは無意味だった。収穫：同
 ビルのダイソーでポチ袋 ✓完了（紀伊國屋の失敗を解
 消）、ユニクロで靴下 ✓完了。⚠ 明日、秋葉に戻る
 理由は消滅。2点が必要なら楽器店（イシバシ／島村）
 ・専門ホビー店へ。\n⑩ 夕食確定：モティ六本木 — 
 日比谷線で秋葉原→六本木は直通・乗換なし。\n整理
 ：梱包材はそもそも不要（ダラーレンジャーの誤記述
 の名残・削除）。ポチ袋はどこでも買えるので専用の
 寄り道なし。今夜の必須は恵比寿ロッカーの50Lのみ。
END:VEVENT
